WEBVTT

1
00:00:01.500 --> 00:00:05.100
Every test is of a run that finishes.

2
00:00:05.100 --> 00:00:08.600
The defects live where they do not.

3
00:00:08.600 --> 00:00:11.900
A comment said ordering was safe.

4
00:00:11.900 --> 00:00:15.200
True of payloads. Not of writes.

5
00:00:15.200 --> 00:00:18.000
Make the first write slow.

6
00:00:18.000 --> 00:00:21.300
The store keeps the older report.

7
00:00:21.300 --> 00:00:24.300
One writer. The newest wins.

8
00:00:24.300 --> 00:00:27.200
Then a worker dies mid-run.

9
00:00:27.200 --> 00:00:30.200
Its half-report outlived it.

10
00:00:30.200 --> 00:00:33.200
So clear it with the requeue.

11
00:00:33.200 --> 00:00:36.200
Review: that was half a fix.

12
00:00:36.200 --> 00:00:39.700
The open connection already sent it.

13
00:00:39.700 --> 00:00:42.600
So retract it, on the wire.

14
00:00:42.600 --> 00:00:46.100
Not done. A reader told done leaves.

15
00:00:46.100 --> 00:00:49.700
The status runs backwards, and holds.

16
00:00:49.700 --> 00:00:53.300
Defects put back. All of them caught.

17
00:00:53.300 --> 00:00:55.700
Test the run that goes wrong.
